; The DirectPlay 3 entry points of DPLAYX.DLL that the game imports by ordinal
; (ordinals as Microsoft's DPLAYX.DLL and Wine's dplayx.dll number them).
; tools/place.py reads this to name the original's import slots;
; `LIB /DEF:link/dplayx.def` turns it into an import library for an ordinary
; link (the toolchain's DPLAY.LIB has none of these).
LIBRARY DPLAYX
EXPORTS
    DirectPlayCreate@12              @1 NONAME
    DirectPlayEnumerateA@8           @2 NONAME
    DirectPlayEnumerateW@8           @3 NONAME
    DirectPlayLobbyCreateA@20        @4 NONAME
    DirectPlayLobbyCreateW@20        @5 NONAME
